  "notes": [
    "The three original routed designs pass all six application profiles, default OpenDB antenna/power checks and macro export. No new place/route was performed.",
    "All three filled worker reports are byte-identical on Windows/Linux and reproduce the prior complete execution ledger after removing only its external case label.",
